-- src:3920 | 8 For greater certainty, this Interim Order applies despite any provision of the Employment Insurance Act or any of its regulations.
@ref Employment Insurance Act, related provisions of SOR/2020-88, s. 5; SOR/2020-89, s. 4; SOR/2020-95, s. 3; SOR/2020-141, s. 3; SOR/2020-169, s. 7; SOR/2020-173, s. 7; SOR/2020-187, s. 5; SOR/2020-188, s. 7; SOR/2020-208, s. 8 (src:3896) (src:3899) (src:3902) (src:3905) (src:3908) (src:3911) (src:3914) (src:3917) (src:3920)
GIVEN `the order is one of the Interim Orders SOR/2020-88, SOR/2020-89, SOR/2020-95, SOR/2020-141, SOR/2020-169, SOR/2020-173, SOR/2020-187, SOR/2020-188 and SOR/2020-208` IS A BOOLEAN
